{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116184","id":3273595354,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7DHxna","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116184","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116184.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116184.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116184","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116184/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116184/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116184/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d27d3dba20c79c7705c984fb0a9da44bbb984947","number":116184,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add support for AIFF audio files","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14325\r\n- Supersedes #96545, which was made with the same purpose but relies on an external library and has a size penalty (45KiB).\r\n- Supersedes #115534 (incorporated into this PR). Both WAV and AIFF tag handling code should be on their own containers to avoid conflicts.\r\n\r\nEnables `AudioStreamWAV::load_from_buffer` to recognize and support AIFF files. Also enables `ResourceImporterWAV` to import AIFF files.\r\n\r\nThe parser is written using the [AIFF 1.3 specification](https://www.mmsp.ece.mcgill.ca/Documents/AudioFormats/AIFF/Docs/AIFF-1.3.pdf) and [AIFC specification](https://www.mmsp.ece.mcgill.ca/Documents/AudioFormats/AIFF/Docs/AIFF-C.9.26.91.pdf) as reference. It integrates nicely with the existing WAV parser:\r\n- Chunks are pretty much the same, 4-char ID followed by 32-bit size.\r\n- AIFF files are entirely big-endian, which can be simply controlled by setting `FileAccess::set_big_endian(true)` once we find out it's one.\r\n- It's pretty hard for chunks of both types to collide (WAVE has `fmt ` and `data`, while AIFF has `COMM` and `SSND`, not counting special types which wouldn't collide anyway), so you don't need to separate checks for each.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe supported types are the following:\r\n- Standard AIFF (8, 16, 24 and 32 bit samples)\r\n- Little-endian AIFF (`sowt` ID, common in many macOS app exports)\r\n- 32 and 64 bit IEEE float (`fl32`/`FL32` and `fl64`/`FL64` IDs)\r\n\r\nAlso, there is no standardized way to use loop points in AIFF, so detection only works for WAV for now.\r\n\r\nText chunks (Name, Author, Copyright and Annotation) are recognized as `title`, `author`, `copyright` and `comment` tags, respectively.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-11T21:26:49Z